# Discipline Engine — Agent Instructions

## Project
Real-life RPG for JEE/NEET students on low-RAM Android (minSdk 29, target 4GB RAM devices like Poco M6 5G).
Kotlin + Jetpack Compose + Room. Dark Glassmorphism theme only.

## Iron Rules (never violate)
1. PERFORMANCE BUDGET: APK < 15MB. No heavy libraries (no Firebase, no image loaders unless needed).
2. Room DB schema changes MUST increment the version in DisciplineDatabase and add a Migration.
3. Every RP value must match master_blueprint.json exactly (+25, +40, +30, +15, -35, -50 boss).
4. Dark theme ONLY (BackgroundCanvas #090D16). No light theme.
5. All new features build on DisciplineDatabase.dao() — never create a second DB.
6. Comments: one-line plain English per function (user is a beginner).

## Phase Roadmap (build only the phase I ask for)
- Phase 1 ✅ DONE: Shell, theme, Room DB (habits, rp_events, streak_state), test RP button
- Phase 2: Real RP/rank logic (Bronze→Conqueror thresholds), streak + miss detection
- Phase 3: Alarm, full-screen intent, reboot resurrection receiver
- Phase 4: Schedule creator (8A/8C logic)
- Phase 5: Camera pushup verification (MediaPipe) + watchdogs (proximity/gyro/siren)
- Phase 6: AccessibilityService Reels/Shorts blocker + settings guard
- Phase 7: PW notification catcher + exam triage engine
- Phase 8: Apple Dock + Gaussian magnification + landscape two-pane
- Phase 9: 365-day heatmap + graphs
- Phase 10: Device admin, hardening, polish

## Build command
./gradlew assembleDebug → APK at app/build/outputs/apk/debug/
